</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="structthemis_1_1plugins_1_1image_1_1_detection_result" kindref="compound">DetectionResult</ref> where each &quot;detection&quot; is an OCR word box. </para>
